{"id":"83aced2788c4ece617c981787998ed785cf5c1ce","url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/999/562.htm","title":"HyperX Cloud Alpha Air 半开放式游戏耳机发售，999 元人民币","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：溯波（实习）","excerpt":"其支持 24-bit / 96kHz 采样；采用 40mm 钕磁发声单元和优化低频表现的低音导管结构，配备可拆卸单向拾音麦克风。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            \r\n            <p data-vmark=\"3f35\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 9 月 8 日消息，HP（惠普）旗下 HyperX（极度未知）上月发布了一系列外设，其中的 <strong>Cloud Alpha Air 半开放式无线耳机现已登陆国内电商平台</strong>，售价 999 元。作为参考，该产品海外定价 149.99 美元<span>（IT之家注：现汇率约合 1,009 元人民币）</span>。</p><p data-vmark=\"bbb2\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/22df967f-79dd-4245-8231-29b697181cc2.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_820\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1440\" data-vmark=\"4da3\" title=\"HyperX Cloud Alpha Air 半开放式游戏耳机发售，999 元人民币\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/22df967f-79dd-4245-8231-29b697181cc2.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/22df967f-79dd-4245-8231-29b697181cc2.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_820\" width=\"1440\" height=\"820\"></p><p data-vmark=\"89a3\">Cloud Alpha Air 支持 24-bit / 96kHz 采样；<strong>采用 40mm 钕磁发声单元和优化低频表现的低音导管结构</strong>，频率响应范围 20~20000Hz ，灵敏度达 97dB，总谐波失真≤2%，阻抗 34Ω，拥有标志性音频专业调教。</p><p data-vmark=\"dff3\">其配备灵敏度达 -42dBV 的吊杆式可拆卸单向拾音驻极体电容麦克风；搭配钢制头梁和记忆泡棉填充超麂皮耳垫。</p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=sVNi2hW04%2B%2BlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOUV9IBA4kmjLAxsU2kfE%2FgVxIAv8crtBVOw8tqoqwsljA2sHH5mzM36Dqxx2oRXBG6pai%2FxwQ%2B%2BLd7qAz%2FZycy4k7BbPIUYUjAyPS51dkcczj%2F4sdtHZ%2BsKjJI%2BY7acCeEZq5p4UsOeVh1s25f8J3MUSFeXo5GTdjvZdyPvH0jFsIYt%2FUDzGQuqI2UqExBRSrmQebDsS0r%2FMZN%2FPqfiSWXTAbOn%2B9C3LMOfvG%2FCFScS1AAgNyXy0xGg%2Fw9AATZwsslD9ZzTfOOXeoxsBuf1JtEuie%2FpBy9wBFg%3D%3D&traceId=215045f717888328331965545e0c02&&union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1788832833@0b56803f_1477_1a07ebedeef_acbe@01\" target=\"_blank\" d